  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop or crush garlic. In a medium saucepan, melt butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.\n• Cook 1/2 garlic until fragrant, 1-2 mins. Add rice, the water and a generous pinch of salt and bring to the boil. Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid. Cook for 10 mins, then remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and the water absorbed, 10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61fb5d6a6fca6e5b9534938e/step-70650055.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, drain sweetcorn, finely chop tomato. Roughly chop spinach. Add veggies to a medium bowl.\n• Cut haloumi into 1cm slices (you should get 4 pieces per person).\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil and remaining garlic over medium-high heat. Cook until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Transfer to a small bowl. Stir in yoghurt. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61fb5d6a6fca6e5b9534938e/step-b6d98f7a.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return frying pan to a high heat. Add corn kernels and cook until lightly browned, 4-5 minutes (cover the pan with a lid if the kernels are “popping” out). Add to the bowl with the veggies.\n• In another medium bowl, combine haloumi, spicy taco seasoning (add less if you're sensitive to heat!) and a drizzle of olive oil.\n• When rice has 5 mins left, return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• When oil is hot, cook haloumi until browned, 1-2 mins each side.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61fb5d6a6fca6e5b9534938e/step-369e26ed.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To salsa, add a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season and toss.\n• Divide rice between bowls. Top with haloumi and salsa.\n• Serve with garlic yoghurt.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61fb5d6a6fca6e5b9534938e/step-cb60818b.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
